  ==
  **Flow tags** — `CRM·PII` = carries Salesforce customer or personal
  data · `UNTRUSTED` = carries attacker-influenceable content that
  reaches the model prompt.
  **Arrow colours** — blue #2563EB edge · purple #7C3AED app ·
  green #16A34A inference · amber #D97706 data · grey #64748B external ·
  red #DC2626 crosses a boundary without a control.
  ==
  10 of the 27 level-1 flows carry CRM·PII; 7 carry UNTRUSTED content;
  F12 carries **both at once, in a single prompt**.
end legend

